ontext</li><li>About two minutes to complete</li></ul></div><aside class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_heroVisualCard__hQwux\" aria-label=\"Luxury care highlights\"><p class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_typebotCardLabel__b75Jb\">Guided questions — personalized matches</p><section class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_heroKeywords__MJEIS\" id=\"assistant\" aria-label=\"AI assistant chat\"><div class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_heroTypebotFrame__bnEHI\"><div class=\"AssistedlyWizard_shell__6FOZr \"><main class=\"AssistedlyWizard_main__vEw3h\"><div class=\"AssistedlyWizard_scrollViewport__J12Ww \" aria-label=\"Conversation\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"AssistedlyWizard_thread__BSW8Q\"><div class=\"AssistedlyWizard_botLine__CZJ4l\"><div class=\"AssistedlyWizard_avatar__2PrEW\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"AssistedlyWizard_botBubble__FADAG\"><div class=\"AssistedlyWizard_urgencyIntro__q78TM\"><p class=\"AssistedlyWizard_urgencyIntroQuestion__H_TyS\">How urgently do you need to find assisted living?</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"AssistedlyWizard_bottomBar__evL4e\"><div class=\"AssistedlyWizard_quickReplies__DYTsG\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"AssistedlyWizard_choiceBtn__WiID_\">Right away</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"AssistedlyWizard_choiceBtn__WiID_\">In the next month</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"AssistedlyWizard_choiceBtn__WiID_\">In more than one month</button></div></div></main></div></div></section></aside></div></section><section class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_section__Xpziv\" id=\"how-it-works\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_sectionTitle__kbpeC\">How It Works</h2><p class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_sectionSubtitle__EZ3OS\">Finding luxury assisted living in Massachusetts is faster with a focused local process.</p><div class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepsGrid__h50d8\"><article class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepCard__Rd8FW\"><div class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepIcon__P88bH\">📋</div><h3 class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepTitle__YVcXW\">Tell Us Your Needs</h3><p class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepDesc__6spum\">We match families with local premium facilities based on care needs, budget, and location.</p></article><article class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepCard__Rd8FW\"><div class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepIcon__P88bH\">🤖</div><h3 class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepTitle__YVcXW\">AI-Powered Matching</h3><p class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepDesc__6spum\">We identify luxury communities that fit your location, care level, and budget preferences.</p></article><article class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepCard__Rd8FW\"><div class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepIcon__P88bH\">✅</div><h3 class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepTitle__YVcXW\">Choose Confidently</h3><p class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_stepDesc__6spum\">Compare options with transparent context before contacting your top choices.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_sectionAlt__QpnkB\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_sectionTitle__kbpeC\">Why Families Trust Us</h2><p class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_sectionSubtitle__EZ3OS\">We provide Massachusetts-focused insights families can trust.</p><div class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustGrid__qloo2\"><article class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCard__6_ZoT\"><div class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCardIcon__oFXdq\">🔍</div><h3 class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCardTitle__ikPAu\">Compliance Tracking</h3><p class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCardDesc__Eh8gf\">Access local facility data, compliance information, and reviews in one place.</p></article><article class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCard__6_ZoT\"><div class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCardIcon__oFXdq\">🤖</div><h3 class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCardTitle__ikPAu\">AI-Powered Matching</h3><p class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCardDesc__Eh8gf\">Our matching engine compares care needs, pricing, and amenities to narrow the best luxury options.</p></article><article class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCard__6_ZoT\"><div class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCardIcon__oFXdq\">📊</div><h3 class=\"LuxuryLandingPage_trustCard